OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with lengthy clear spells.
OL,7,FIt will stay dry overnight with clear
OL,8,Fperiods, some frost in places again
OL,9,Fand some fog patches developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA bright but chilly start with
OL,12,Fan early frost in places.
OL,13,
OL,14,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,15,FLargely cloudy on Tuesday and
OL,16,FWednesday with rain at times. Bright
OL,17,Fspells between bands of showery rain
OL,18,Fon Thursday.
